  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Ephraim spake trembling, he exalted himself in Israel; but when he offended in Baal, he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now they sin more and more, and have made them molten images of their silver,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "idols according to their own understanding, all of it the work of the craftsmen: they say of them, Let the men that sacrifice kiss the calves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore they shall be as the morning cloud, and as the early dew that passeth away, as the chaff",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is driven with the whirlwind out of the floor, and as the smoke out of the chimney.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God from the land of Egypt, and thou shalt know no god but me: for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no saviour beside me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ I did know thee in the wilderness, in the land of great drought.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "According to their pasture, so were they filled; they were filled, and their heart was exalted; therefore have they forgotten me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore I will be unto them as a lion: as a leopard by the way will I observe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will meet them as a bear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bereaved",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of her whelps",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and will rend the caul of their heart, and there will I devour them like a lion: the wild beast shall tear them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ O Israel, thou hast destroyed thyself; but in me",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thine help.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will be thy king: where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is any other",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that may save thee in all thy cities? and thy judges of whom thou saidst, Give me a king and princes?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I gave thee a king in mine anger, and took",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "away in my wrath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The iniquity of Ephraim",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bound up; his sin",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sorrows of a travailing woman shall come upon him: he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an unwise son; for he should not stay long in",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the place of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the breaking forth of children.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will ransom them from the power of the grave; I will redeem them from death: O death, I will be thy plagues; O grave, I will be thy destruction: repentance shall be hid from mine eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Though he be fruitful among",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brethren, an east wind shall come, the wind of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.13.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.13.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall come up from the wilderness, and his spring shall become dry, and his fountain shall be dried up: he shall spoil the treasure of all pleasant vessels.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samaria shall become desolate; for she hath rebelled against her God: they shall fall by the sword: their infants shall be dashed in pieces, and their women with child shall be ripped up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
